00:07:24.819 --> 00:07:25.778
The atrium.

00:07:25.778 --> 00:07:29.782
Since it connects all the floors
and has the most access to daylight,

00:07:29.782 --> 00:08:10.615
could become a breeding ground
for different plants.

00:08:15.161 --> 00:08:16.496
We see everything

00:08:16.496 --> 00:08:20.124
from a human centric point of view
and how could we not?

00:08:20.416 --> 00:08:23.920
Everything around us exists
in relation to us,

00:08:24.378 --> 00:08:26.839
and fundamentally it's a tool to serve us.

00:08:27.006 --> 00:08:28.841
Form follows function.

00:08:28.841 --> 00:08:30.384
The human function.

00:08:30.384 --> 00:08:35.806
So buildings existence is justified
as long as it serves us

00:08:36.140 --> 00:08:38.309
and as long as we like it.

00:08:38.893 --> 00:08:42.730
And maybe because we relatively
have pretty short lives,

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:48.653
we think about the lifespan of buildings
in a very limited way to typical life

00:08:48.653 --> 00:08:52.114
expectancy of a building
is something around 50 years,

00:08:52.532 --> 00:08:56.452
and by that time
the buildings become so deteriorated

00:08:56.452 --> 00:09:00.289
or outdated that you have to decide
whether you want to demolish it

00:09:00.289 --> 00:09:01.457
or you want to renovate it.

00:09:01.457 --> 00:09:06.045
It's so hard to even conceptualize
a world without us.

00:09:06.462 --> 00:09:10.424
But in the grand timespan of the earth,

00:09:10.508 --> 00:09:14.136
and even in the grand scale of the galaxy,

00:09:14.303 --> 00:09:17.598
we are just a tiny, tiny little blip.

00:09:18.224 --> 00:09:23.020
If it happens for some freak accident,
we just get wiped off

00:09:23.020 --> 00:09:24.522
the face of the earth.

00:09:24.522 --> 00:09:28.401
Or maybe it happens
in a couple of thousands of years.

00:09:28.401 --> 00:09:31.696
Maybe it's
just the natural decline of our species,

00:09:31.904 --> 00:09:35.157
or we just end up killing ourselves.

00:09:35.366 --> 00:09:37.076
What would happen to our buildings?

00:09:37.076 --> 00:09:39.412
Which of them would become artifact?

00:09:39.412 --> 00:09:49.005
And what do they become without us?

